    "updated_at": "2020-06-01T22:32:11Z",
    "body": "Is there a reason the set of service UUIDs is more sensitive than the other things in the [`AdvertisingEvent`](https://webbluetoothcg.github.io/web-bluetooth/#fire-an-advertisementreceived-event), especially the manufacturer data?",
