    "created_at": "2020-06-01T22:33:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-06-01T22:33:39Z",
    "body": "I don't think it is particularly more or less sensitive than manufacturer data but the exposure of service UUIDs (and associated data) seems like a hole in the permissions model we have defined for Bluetooth GATT services.",
