    "created_at": "2020-06-03T21:37:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-06-03T21:37:57Z",
    "body": "This should likely also apply to the Bluetooth Scanning API and to make that work I think we need to add an `optionalServices` parameter to the [`BluetoothLEScanOptions`](https://webbluetoothcg.github.io/web-bluetooth/scanning#dictdef-bluetoothlescanoptions) dictionary so that sites can express which service's data they are interested in receiving.",
