    "created_at": "2020-06-03T21:44:44Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-06-03T21:44:44Z",
    "body": "The `BluetoothLEScanOptions` does include a [`BluetoothLEScanFilterInit`](https://webbluetoothcg.github.io/web-bluetooth/#dictdef-bluetoothlescanfilterinit) which contains a filter for services. The `optionalServices` would be useful if `acceptAllAdvertisements` is true in that case.\r\n\r\nThis sounds good, I'll work on uploading a commit that introduces these updates.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
